Route46_Text_CamperTed::
	.string "I did my best but came up short.\p"
	.string "No excuses--I admit I lost.$"

Route46_Text_HikerBaileyIntro::
	.string "Awright! I’ll show you the power of\n"
	.string "mountain POKéMON!$"

Route46_Text_HikerBaileyDefeat::
